# Build context for apps/worker/Dockerfile is the repo root (fly deploy ... .).
# Keep installed modules, build output, secrets and git history out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/links/.dev.vars
docs
scripts
*.md
